<title>UK: Rabobank sets 100 million rand five-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Rabobank sets 100 million rand five-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros Bank Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RABOBANK NEDERLAND BA</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN ZAR   COUPON     15.00     MATURITY    18.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.575   PAY DATE    18.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/UK/ZA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NETHS     HOME CTRY  NETHS     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
